Troubleshooting
Common Issues
Workflow not triggering:

Check branch names match workflow configuration
Verify .github/workflows/ directory structure
Ensure YAML syntax is correct
Tests failing in pipeline but pass locally:

Check Python version consistency
Verify all dependencies in requirements.txt
Review environment variables
Permission errors:

Check repository settings > Actions > General
Enable read/write permissions for GITHUB_TOKEN
Slow pipeline execution:

Cache dependencies using actions/cache@v3
Parallelize independent jobs
Optimize test execution
Debug Commands
# View workflow run logs
gh run list
gh run view <run-id> --log

# Check repository secrets
gh secret list

# Validate workflow syntax
cat .github/workflows/ci.yml | python3 -c "import yaml, sys; yaml.safe_load(sys.stdin)"
